{"id":"n70850-1-8","stage":3,"title":"절반 · 一半","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n70850-1-8-1","ko":"하루가 지났는데 일의 절반이나 남았다고?","zh":"已经过了一天，工作居然还有半部分没做？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"하루가","meaning":"某天，一日，有一天","explanation":"하루：某天，一日，有一天；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"하루","audio":"/audio/621a158068fae5de1aee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49315","senseId":"3","lemma":"하루","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하루가","audio":"/audio/6dd220d6cf8b225f5b5f.mp3"}},{"text":"지났는데","meaning":"过，过去","explanation":"지나다：过，过去；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"지나다","audio":"/audio/7d68e3b7dc1c001cae3b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82142","senseId":"1","lemma":"지나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지났는데","audio":"/audio/90962de99dbd79119d8e.mp3"}},{"text":"일의","meaning":"事情，工作","explanation":"일：事情，工作；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"1","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일의","audio":"/audio/f453291d4827ec0c4170.mp3"}},{"text":"절반이나","meaning":"一半，对半","explanation":"절반：一半，对半；이나：表示不止预期的数量、举例或退而求其次等，需结合整句语气。","readings":[{"term":"절반","audio":"/audio/4ca44e95373854468161.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70850","senseId":"1","lemma":"절반","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"절반이나","audio":"/audio/d3e5be80d18310026827.mp3"}},{"text":"남았다고?","meaning":"剩，剩下","explanation":"남다：剩，剩下；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；다고：重复、强调或确认所说的内容；带 요 时为礼貌表达。","readings":[{"term":"남다","audio":"/audio/10946131f919fe8058dd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64552","senseId":"1","lemma":"남다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"남았다고","audio":"/audio/477764e008b1137d3f2d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"621a158068fae5de","term":"하루","zh":"某天，一日，有一天","audio":"/audio/621a158068fae5de1aee.mp3","entryId":"49315","definition":"不特定的某个日子。","pronunciation":["하루"]},{"id":"7d68e3b7dc1c001c","term":"지나다","zh":"过，过去","audio":"/audio/7d68e3b7dc1c001cae3b.mp3","entryId":"82142","definition":"随时间流逝，脱离那个时期。","pronunciation":["지나다"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事情，工作","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"为了实现某事而使用身体或精神的活动；或指该活动的对象。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"4ca44e9537385446","term":"절반","zh":"一半，对半","audio":"/audio/4ca44e95373854468161.mp3","entryId":"70850","definition":"把一个分成两半；或指那样分出来的一半。","pronunciation":["절반"]},{"id":"10946131f919fe80","term":"남다","zh":"剩，剩下","audio":"/audio/10946131f919fe8058dd.mp3","entryId":"64552","definition":"没用完，留下了一部分。","pronunciation":["남ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/33ec034b8b9cb66c6015.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n70850-1-8-2","ko":"네, 다 끝내려면 하루가 더 필요할 것 같습니다.","zh":"是的，要全部完成的话，看来还需要一天时间。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行。","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都。","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}},{"text":"끝내려면","meaning":"结束，完成","explanation":"끝내다：结束，完成；려면：表示实现意图所需的条件：“如果想要……”。","readings":[{"term":"끝내다","audio":"/audio/686f8e089bf22cd01d10.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29692","senseId":"1","lemma":"끝내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"끝내려면","audio":"/audio/eb2c7915e09b100b308a.mp3"}},{"text":"하루가","meaning":"一天","explanation":"하루：一天；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"하루","audio":"/audio/621a158068fae5de1aee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49315","senseId":"1","lemma":"하루","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하루가","audio":"/audio/6dd220d6cf8b225f5b5f.mp3"}},{"text":"더","meaning":"再，多","explanation":"더：再，多。","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"1","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}},{"text":"필요할","meaning":"必需，必要","explanation":"필요하다：必需，必要；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"필요하다","audio":"/audio/b98947c9698402e3d07e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"46945","senseId":"1","lemma":"필요하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"필요할","audio":"/audio/2f7ed338bf7b18137eb7.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","explanation":"것：表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"6","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같습니다.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같습니다","audio":"/audio/70b461d79f2fe5361c43.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全，都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58175","definition":"无剩余或遗漏，所有的。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"686f8e089bf22cd0","term":"끝내다","zh":"结束，完成","audio":"/audio/686f8e089bf22cd01d10.mp3","entryId":"29692","definition":"做完事情。","pronunciation":["끈내다"]},{"id":"621a158068fae5de","term":"하루","zh":"一天","audio":"/audio/621a158068fae5de1aee.mp3","entryId":"49315","definition":"从晚上12点到第二天晚上12点的24个小时。","pronunciation":["하루"]},{"id":"1e2cb79b6970d021","term":"더","zh":"再，多","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3","entryId":"26829","definition":"添补而继续。","pronunciation":["더"]},{"id":"b98947c9698402e3","term":"필요하다","zh":"必需，必要","audio":"/audio/b98947c9698402e3d07e.mp3","entryId":"46945","definition":"一定要有的。","pronunciation":["피료하다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/5966f266627b8b4048e1.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.193,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=70850","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":119,"sequenceScore":3.6697,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是的，要全部完成的话，看来还需要一天时间。","已经过了一天，工作居然还有半部分没做？","你要辞职去读研究生了？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["已经过了一天，工作居然还有半部分没做？","你要辞职去读研究生了？","是的，要全部完成的话，看来还需要一天时间。"],"answer":2}]}
